WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.950
The Control Room opens, followed by the Chaos Lab. The demo receiver starts healthy.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.550
The receiver is set to return HTTP 500. Generated deliveries build up in the retry queue.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:16.150
The delivery trace shows HTTP 500 attempts persisted by the worker.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:22.990
The receiver returns to HTTP 200. Queued deliveries complete as their next attempts come due.

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:27.480
The retry queue reaches zero. The Control Room shows the updated totals.
